---
source: disk/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"isosize\")"
---
Output the length of an iso9660 filesystem

Usage: isosize [options] <iso9660_image_file> ...

Arguments:
  <FILES>...  ISO 9660 image files

Options:
  -x, --sectors           Show sector count and sector size
  -d, --divisor <number>  Divisor for the output size (when not using --sectors) [default: 1]
  -h, --help              Print help
